# QuantForg Design Freeze (post-RC3)

The QuantForg Design System is **LOCKED**. RC3 is the permanent visual baseline.

## Forbidden

- Redesign or restyle existing UI
- New visual patterns, tokens, or component chrome
- New navigation models or interaction models
- Subjective polish / “make it nicer” changes

## Allowed only

- Verified bugs
- Accessibility issues
- Responsive issues
- Performance regressions
- Proven usability issues discovered during testing

## Inheritance

Every future UI must inherit from the existing Design Bible + RC3 shell language (`docs/design/`, ADR-0022, shared desk chrome, steel tokens, IBM Plex).

Do not modify `components/terminal|book|research|counsel/` unless fixing a verified bug/a11y/responsive/perf issue above.

Tag target for the frozen frontend baseline: `v1.0.0-frontend`.
